WEBVTT

00:05:59.516 --> 00:06:01.514
I don't feel like that was the case,

00:06:01.538 --> 00:06:05.142
I think actually more often than not
we did the right thing,

00:06:05.166 --> 00:06:07.142
we tried to do right by vendors,

00:06:07.166 --> 00:06:09.165
we tried to do right by the people.

00:06:09.189 --> 00:06:12.205
When you get bigger
those things get complicated

00:06:12.229 --> 00:06:14.394
and there's always
two sides to every story.

00:06:15.216 --> 00:06:16.427
AG: There are.

00:06:16.451 --> 00:06:18.782
Well, I certainly want
to hear more of your side.

00:06:18.806 --> 00:06:23.072
So let's begin with,
what was the mission when you joined?

00:06:23.096 --> 00:06:24.841
DF: To create a world

00:06:24.865 --> 00:06:27.315
where people make a life
and not just a living.

00:06:27.708 --> 00:06:30.025
Or enable a world,
where, you now, there's --